    <!-- The battery mode's window, opened from its tile. -->
    <string name="fountain_battery_mode_explain">Unplugged, the fountain switches to battery mode by itself: the pump runs, then sleeps, for the times below. Plugged in again, it goes back to its own mode. Neither mode can be chosen meanwhile.</string>
